1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Gravity just switched off.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,260
For five seconds.

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:04,660
Second one.

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,040
Your stomach drops,

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:07,400
like the top of a roller

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:07,720
coaster.

7
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,440
But you don't fly off.

8
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:10,500
Not yet.

9
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,580
Earth is still spinning at 1

10
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,340
,670 kilometres per hour.

11
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:17,220
Nothing pulls you down anymore,

12
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,160
so you keep going straight,

13
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,060
while the ground curves away under

14
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:21,520
your feet.

15
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:22,920
You drift up.

16
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,680
About forty centimetres in five seconds.

17
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,100
Second two.

18
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:28,560
Cars can't brake.

19
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,500
No weight means no grip.

20
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,980
They just keep rolling.

21
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,220
Second three.

22
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,060
You try a tiny hop.

23
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:36,260
Bad idea.

24
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,660
Two seconds later,

25
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:39,540
you're at the second -floor windows.

26
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:40,840
Second four.

27
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,920
The air above you starts drifting

28
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,520
off into space.

29
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:45,560
Then,

30
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:47,060
second five.

31
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,460
But here's the twist.

32
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,800
The danger was never gravity turning

33
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:51,280
off.

34
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,300
It's gravity coming back.

35
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:56,080
Everything that drifted up comes down.

36
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,140
At once.

37
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,460
Including you.

38
00:00:59,040 --> 00:00:59,900
Five metres up.

39
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:01,560
You hit the ground at thirty

40
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,040
-six kilometres per hour.

41
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:05,300
So if gravity switched off right

42
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:06,180
now...

43
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:07,080
would you hold on,

44
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:07,860
or jump?

